---
description: >-
  Line chart using the inline `xychart horizontal` orientation keyword
  (rather than the chartOrientation config option), with every point in the
  single line series given an explicit label ("Small", "Medium", "Large").
---
xychart horizontal
  title "Model Sizes"
  x-axis ["Model A", "Model B", "Model C"]
  y-axis "Parameters" 0 --> 100
  line [20 "Small", 50 "Medium", 90 "Large"]
